#: includes/class-report.php:70
msgid "SiteCare Score"
msgstr "Puntuación de SiteCare"

#: includes/class-report.php:147
msgid ""
"If you’d like to speak with a WordPress expert to help resolve these issues, "
"complete the form below and a SiteCare representative will reach out to "
"offer tailored guidance."
msgstr ""
"Si desea hablar con un experto en WordPress para ayudar a resolver estos "
"problemas, complete el formulario a continuación y un representante de "
"SiteCare se pondrá en contacto para ofrecerle una orientación personalizada."

#: includes/class-report.php:150
msgid "Contact SiteCare"
msgstr "Contacte con SiteCare"

#: includes/class-scan.php:39
msgid ""
"Your website scan is underway. We'll have your SiteCare Score ready for you "
"in a flash!"
msgstr ""
"El análisis de su sitio web está en curso. ¡Tendremos su Puntuación SiteCare "
"lista en un instante!"

#: includes/class-scan.php:43
msgid "A thorough check-up takes a little time. Thanks for hanging tight!"
msgstr "Un chequeo completo toma un poco de tiempo. ¡Gracias por su paciencia!"

#: includes/class-scan.php:79
msgid "Initializing scan"
msgstr "Iniciando análisis"

#: includes/class-start.php:23
msgid "Get My SiteCare Score"
msgstr "Obtener mi Puntuación SiteCare"

#: includes/class-start.php:27
msgid ""
"By clicking the \"Scan my Website\" button, you will initiate a multipoint "
"WordPress site\n"
"            health diagnostic that will thoroughly assess the status of your "
"website. This diagnostic tool will analyze\n"
"            various aspects of your WordPress site and server health and "
"will provide you with recommended improvements\n"
"            to enhance its performance and security."
msgstr ""
"Al hacer clic en el botón ‘Analizar mi sitio web’, iniciará un diagnóstico "
"multipunto de salud\n"
"de su sitio WordPress que evaluará exhaustivamente el estado de su página. "
"Esta herramienta\n"
"de diagnóstico analizará varios aspectos de la salud de su sitio WordPress y "
"servidor,\n"
"y le proporcionará recomendaciones para mejorar su rendimiento y seguridad."

#: includes/class-start.php:41
msgid "Please email me a report"
msgstr "Por favor, envíeme un informe por correo electrónico"

#: includes/class-start.php:47
msgid "Email the report to"
msgstr "Enviar el informe a"

#: includes/class-start.php:60
msgid "Scan My Website"
msgstr "Analizar mi sitio web"

#: includes/class-start.php:63
msgid ""
"Clicking \"Scan my Website\" allows us to track usage data to help improve "
"future recommendations in our\n"
"                reports. "
msgstr ""
"Al hacer clic en ‘Analizar mi sitio web’, nos permite recopilar datos de uso "
"para ayudar a mejorar las recomendaciones futuras en\n"
"nuestros informes. "

#: includes/class-toolbar.php:90
msgid "View Latest Report"
msgstr "Ver el último informe"

#: includes/class-toolbar.php:93
msgid "View Score History"
msgstr "Ver historial de puntuaciones"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://github.com/sitecare/sitecare-score"
msgstr "https://github.com/sitecare/sitecare-score"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Find hidden technical debt and track your WordPress site health with our "
"comprehensive scanning tool."
msgstr ""
"Descubra deuda técnica oculta y siga la salud de su sitio WordPress con "
"nuestra herramienta de análisis integral."

#. Author of the plugin/theme
msgid "SiteCare"
msgstr "SiteCare"

